{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_05",
  "title": "溺火",
  "storyCode": "EA-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ea208f0273bc2ea9bf4f95d8bc61d23a2b75236ff8e7c37101ea31ea7572c68e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g12_castlecorridor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "堡壘內的僕役已經全數被我遣退，那麼這腳步聲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，是你啊。來找我有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不問我為什麼還回得來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不問。你回來了，僅此而已，我忠心的僕臣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，你能為我帶來一位什麼樣的客人，我心裡自然有數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……宵禁開始了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這也不算違背了我的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失敗了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "納斯爾紗仍在此處，我也仍在此處，談何失敗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "期限是夏末節。就算黑霧以不聽人言聞名，這一點想必也還記得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，我該如何理解你的隻言片語呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者……你也覺得話語的交流，不如法術與毀滅來得直接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛布拉娜話音未落，泛著冷光的枝葉就從黑霧中探出，直指她的咽喉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與此同時，她的槍也刺進了厚重的霧氣深處，紫色的火光在其中隱約可見，只等一個念頭就將霧氣燃盡。\n但枝葉畢竟並未刺進愛布拉娜的咽喉，紫火也並未在黑霧中間燃起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夏末節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夏末節第二天的朝陽升起之前，我們都會得到那個結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於現在……我們都不過是在虛張聲勢罷了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛布拉娜維持著刺入黑霧的姿勢，但頃刻之後，她咽喉前的枝葉憑空消失，她槍尖的火焰也隨之熄滅。\n黑霧隨即散去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還在這裡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，還有事嗎？關於深池？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這裡只有你我，我最忠心的僕臣，我允許你再度提起這個詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝您的寬宏，但是，不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫助一個國家建立的鬼魂也仍然是鬼魂，鬼魂不應該被銘刻在歷史上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我的確擔憂那天和我一樣留在原地的幾位同僚……他們如今在何處？他們是否會對您不利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無需擔心。而且，這應當不是你冒著風險一直留到現在的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……在回來的路上，我看見了一片混亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的人越來越狂躁，為了一點東西……甚至不為了什麼就大打出手，而另一些人卻像木偶般僵在原地……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "彷彿他們都是……當年隨我們一同對抗維多利亞人的鬼魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們也會沒入黑暗嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡畢竟是納斯爾紗，紅龍的巢穴，塔拉的首府。我怕這裡發生的一切都將震動整個塔拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看起來仍不信服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下……我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歸根究柢，我只有一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有這個問題，我懇請您給我一個答覆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我准許你的僭越。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深吸氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛布拉娜殿下，那個未來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個您曾向深池許諾，向所有塔拉人許諾的未來，那個塔拉人能自由書寫自己的夢想的未來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是假的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "校官的全身不住顫抖，連日來潛藏在心底的恐懼在一瞬間攫住了他。\n那恐懼和自己的下場無關。他不怕像同僚那樣被黑霧吞沒，不怕自己因為觸怒紅龍而死。\n他只怕從紅龍口中聽見那個自己從來不敢設想的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕無虛假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經回答你了，校官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紅龍的聲音飄渺、虛弱，卻不容置疑。\n聽著這無數次指揮自己走向勝利的聲音，男人的脊背緩緩挺直。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者……你只是沒有相信以外的選擇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我相信您，相信您如同此前無數次一樣，選擇令人費解，甚至看起來走不通的道路，但總能將我們帶到離那個理想更近的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的信任倒的確值得我的一聲感謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，納斯爾紗城內的秩序並不需要你去維護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你能從黑林中歸來，那麼你此刻就應當回到黑林中去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到夏末節過去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“清晨我走入黑林，呼喚迷霧”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽見那黑林外傳來的歌聲了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "距離你出城，也就不過一次日出日落的時間……做得不錯，拉芙希妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g10_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城內竟然發生了這樣的事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草，你姐姐……她究竟在謀劃什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曾有人向我保證，她的謀劃對塔拉有益而無害。然而無論是她，還是幫她作證的人，此刻我都無法相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "守靈人，已經到這份上了，你們都不幫葦草一把嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她為了葬禮而來，我們也只為此才接納她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論如何，我已知曉逝者的生平了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿著這些繩結和花環，我們到外面去，葬禮就要開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人們收起分歧，默默站起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有的守靈人都低聲唱著歌，手頭做著不同的事情。\n他們中有的人在裝點逝者的遺體——但那也僅僅是往木匣上擺放繩結和花環罷了。\n有的人在木匣周圍架起柴草。\n有的人則一邊唱著，一邊往前來參加葬禮的流民們手中分發蠟燭。\n小小的，明亮的火光在營地各處搖曳。\n拉芙希妮也分到一盞，她小心地將其捧在胸前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不認識逝者，說實話也沒什麼重要的事情要說……但是，在我故鄉的葬禮上，大家都可以隨便說話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，這本就是塔拉人尊敬逝者的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便已經結束，生命仍然值得慶祝，更不用說生者的歡欣對死者而言即是告慰。請隨意交談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還做了一些點心……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也請自由分享。稍後我們也會有飲食提供給各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，考慮到庫林先生英年早逝，又因城內變故橫死，一些過度的行為還請各位克制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，在還火的過程中，請各位聽我們的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫蘭，你們那邊的葬禮是這樣舉辦的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老實說就只是停靈守夜而已，並沒有這麼多傳統的步驟，我也不知道“還火”究竟是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正等一下聽人家的就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草，你以前參加過這種儀式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g12_castlecorridor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉芙希妮已經與守靈人會合，英雄真正的葬禮開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“清晨我走入黑林，呼喚迷霧，踏上通往戰場的路途”……這首歌你會唱嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您明知故問了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有多少次，我都是唱著這首歌，帶著年輕人們走向戰場的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g14_galekingruins_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是誰？是誰在唱歌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，好不容易從黑林裡逃出來，都已經走到了舊王城的遺址，怎麼還是能聽見這首歌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道我還沒走出黑林？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不對，是……遺跡中央的熔爐在發出聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多美的旋律啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有笛聲，沒有戰鼓……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有身後鐘聲……穿過霧中的水珠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許我該回去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許我想要的東西，只有現在才能看清……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我真的有資格……從納斯爾紗逃走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g10_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾瑪，給你，這是今天的麵包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你還願意分一口吃的給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前你不是也把吃的分給我嗎？就當作是報恩吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你一直盯著我手裡的麵包，到底……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）克制，克制……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）她是艾瑪，她是之前曾經把麵包分給你的人，你得幫她，你得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）艾瑪，我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是、只是想說，你都病多久了，一直下不了床，接下來的日子不好過啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“沒有笛聲，沒有戰鼓”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼突然唱起這首歌了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遠處……好像有人在唱……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在還火儀式開始之前，請死者的親友致辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……只有一份悼詞，是涅梅絲寫好交給我，讓我在葬禮上唸的。這樣可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然可以，請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“給庫林……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“庫林，也許過不了多久，我就會遭遇和你同樣的下場……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g2_citystreets_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“……現在輪到我，替你背上這已經增殖到一個人的身軀難以承受的重擔。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“別了，或者很快再見，庫林。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“願你我最終……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“在溫暖的火中重逢。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與悼詞唸完幾乎同時，一簇火焰被投向木匣周圍的柴草，整個柴堆熊熊燃燒起來。\n人們按照守靈人的指示，在火堆旁圍成一圈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請用自己的雙眼確認，死者已在火中得享安寧，不再徘徊人間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，請將燭火擺在離火堆盡可能近的地方，也可以直接將蠟燭投入火中，把火還給死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果對死者有任何話想說，都請對著火焰大聲說出口。無論是生者的讚美還是斥責，那都是記憶，都是逝者旅途中的慰藉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把火還給死者之後，請不要離開，共同在此為死者守靈，直到火焰熄滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的守靈人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "願你獲得安息，未曾謀面的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……騙子，還有英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫蘭彎下腰，將蠟燭放在火邊。火舌一瞬間就將蠟燭吞沒，幾乎撲上了她的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草，要不要離火近一點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果在場有任何一個人沒資格紀念庫林，那只能是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是救不了他的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫蘭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當他決定要當一名真正的英雄時，他就已經不容於紅龍的那座巢穴了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論如何，把火還給他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓塵歸塵，土歸土，讓死者帶著我們的回憶沉睡，生者還要繼續生活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還火……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓死者帶著我們的回憶沉睡……讓生者……繼續生活下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在拉芙希妮若有所思的時間裡，還過火的人們紛紛坐到離火堆更遠的地方，最終手持燭火的只剩她一個。\n她沉默著上前，將手裡的燭火投入了熊熊燃燒的火堆之中。\n死者已矣。\n那些躊躇滿志的、忘乎所以的、如夢初醒的、聲嘶力竭的片段，此刻都在火中燃盡，化為逸散的煙霧，或是沉默的灰燼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
